    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.01",
    "summary": "Set up terrain before play, using any mix of these methods:\n\n- Mark a boundary with a base or mat and put 1 or more features entirely inside it.\n- Put a single feature on the battlefield by itself.\n- Put several features together so they outline a shared boundary.\n\nThe ground each boundary or feature covers is a **terrain area**. Use the mission's deployment map for these areas where it gives them; otherwise agree them before the battle starts.",
